<!--
A gap is anything the project knows it needs but does not yet have. Foundation
discoveries land here when the pull fails or returns partial; the gap closes
when the foundation Milestone completes and the evidence lands on disk.

Severity tiers:
- High: blocks any draft-tier work. The gate is OPEN as long as any High remains.
- Medium: blocks published deliverables but allows internal drafts.
- Low: parking lot. Nice to have. Does not gate work.

Do not edit gap items directly. Edit GOTM.md and re-derive this file.
-->

